        <briefdescription>
<para>Delete DelBB. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>DelBB will be removed from its Parent and erased from available trees if it exists. Then the callback will be called. Finally, DelBB will be deleted. Under Eager <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_generic_dom_tree_updater_1a2655b89361decf2c1493792dc14e5a56" kindref="member">UpdateStrategy</ref>, DelBB will be processed immediately. Under Lazy <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_generic_dom_tree_updater_1a2655b89361decf2c1493792dc14e5a56" kindref="member">UpdateStrategy</ref>, DelBB will be queued until a flush event and all available trees are up-to-date. Assert if any instruction of DelBB is modified while awaiting deletion. Multiple callbacks can be queued for one DelBB under Lazy <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_generic_dom_tree_updater_1a2655b89361decf2c1493792dc14e5a56" kindref="member">UpdateStrategy</ref>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
